<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12867" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-κλῐσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slope,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cleom.
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.459
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>turning off, decline,</i> of fortune, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.611a
			</span></i>; of disease, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.424
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				58.98
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>stooping, descent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.970d
			</span></i>; of the sun, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aem.</u>
				17
			</span></i>; of a ship, <i>rolling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				47
			</span></i> (pl.); of a crowd, <i>swaying to and fro,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>passing away from</i> a <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέντρον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				57.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>turning aside,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				p.384H.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
